Each index records its source branch (release) and commit in its `meta` table and in
index/latest.json.

Modifications: the documentation is split into sections, and each section is stored with a
short machine-generated context sentence (written by an open-weight Qwen model; the model is
recorded per index), search embeddings (BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5) and a keyword index. The page
text itself is unchanged. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by ServiceNow, Inc.

The search models (BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5, BAAI/bge-reranker-base; MIT License) are downloaded
from Hugging Face at first run and are not redistributed here.
